  "steps": [
    "Fry the onion in oil over medium heat for 8 minutes until soft and golden at the edges.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger, cook for a minute, then stir in all the ground spices and toast for 30 seconds until fragrant.",
    "Tip in the tomatoes and let them cook down for 5 minutes into a thick base.",
    "Add the chickpeas and coconut milk, then simmer gently for 10 minutes so the flavours marry.",
    "Stir the spinach through in handfuls until just wilted.",
    "Finish with a good squeeze of lemon and season. Serve with rice or warm flatbread."
  ],
  "notes": "Mash a few of the chickpeas against the side of the pan to thicken the sauce naturally. It's even better the next day."
}
